# ============================================================
# 本仓库只收录「本人编写的脚本」和「README 展示截图」
# 第三方付费美术资源、模型、音频、构建产物、AssetBundle 均不上传
# ============================================================

# 忽略根目录下的所有内容
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Assets/

# Assets 下只放行自己写的脚本和截图
/Assets/*
!/Assets/MyAssets/
/Assets/MyAssets/*
!/Assets/MyAssets/Scripts/
!/Assets/MyAssets/Scripts.meta
!/Assets/Screenshots/
!/Assets/Screenshots.meta

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 以下是标准 Unity 忽略项（防止以后误提交生成文件）
# ------------------------------------------------------------
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/

# IDE
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# Unity 生成文件
*.assetbundle
*.unitypackage
crashlytics-build.properties
sysinfo.txt
debug.log
